# The server image build context is this directory (src/). The whole context is uploaded to the
# Docker Build Cloud builder on every build, so exclude everything the image never reads. The
# Dockerfile restores and publishes Switchboard.Server (transitively Switchboard.Core) from source,
# so only .cs/.csproj/.sln files are needed.

# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/TestResults/

# Local databases, NuGet packages, and runtime state
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.nupkg
**/*.snupkg
**/logs/
**/*.log

# Not read by the server image build
.dockerignore
*.md
*.bat
*.sh
